            <p><b>Scenario:</b> Add Overall Evaluation Grade</p>
            <step>Navigate to Evaluation Grades settings</step>
            <step>Click Add and fill in grade details (name, mapping reference, risk points, color, regulation group, next evaluation days)</step>
            <step>Save the overall evaluation grade</step>
